# Code-signing material. Never belongs in a public repo even briefly — one
# careless `git add .` here permanently leaks a private key, since it stays
# recoverable from history even after a later removal. Keep certs and keys
# entirely outside the working tree (this project's live outside ~/Desktop).
*.p12
*.key
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
CSC_LINK*.txt
*-password.txt
